<title>SINGAPORE: Wee Poh half year '96 profit at S$2.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Wee Poh half year '96 profit at S$2.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to December 31 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    2.43	 vs    nil</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)	   2.92	 vs    nil</p>
<p>    Turnover		     76.12	 vs    nil</p>
<p>    Other income		  0.13	 vs    nil</p>
<p>    Interest expense	    0.21	 vs    nil</p>
<p>    Depreciation		  1.12	 vs    nil</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		4.07	 vs    nil</p>
<p>    Tax			     1.06	 vs    nil</p>
<p>    Minorities		   (0.60)	vs    nil</p>
<p>Note - Newly-listed infrastructure company, Wee Poh Holdings Ltd, said no comparative figures were available as the group was formed in the current financial year.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703083)</p>
